  stableId: quest.world2.two-watchfires
  title: The Two Watchfires
  category: 1
  requiredClassId:
  requiredLevel: 35
  version: 1
  offer: The Basalt Needle and Ember Crown are the two great landmarks of this face. We left survey cases at the end of each approach trail. Chart both sites and record the patrol movements you can see. Visit them in either order, then bring me your observations.
  activeDialogue: The Needle station lies east of the basalt spires, south of Willowford. The Crown station overlooks the crater from the northwest end of its approach road. Inspect both survey cases; keep your footing and watch for patrols.
  turnInDialogue: Two landmarks, two guarded approaches. The reports give us a reliable map of the patrols, but nothing yet explains why the Ancient Road Dragon appeared in Arborium. Envoy Tamsin is gathering the Order's records in Willowford. Take our findings to her.
  locationHint: Survey the trail ends beside the Basalt Needle and northwest of Ember Crown. Both sites are marked on the atlas while this quest is active.
  turnInHint: Return to Expedition Warden Ivara, beside the southern gate inside Cinderwatch.
